    "innovation": "Using nine years of global satellite data, this paper demonstrates that the coupling coefficient between oceanic currents and surface wind stress is a linear function of the mean surface wind, thereby quantifying a global sink of mesoscale eddy energy from the ocean to the atmosphere.",
